  "sketch": "// Piezo buzzer on D8.\nconst int buzzerPin = 8;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(buzzerPin, OUTPUT);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  tone(buzzerPin, 880, 200);\n  delay(1000);\n  tone(buzzerPin, 660, 200);\n  delay(1000);\n}\n",
